# Examples

Checking for general status class:

```rust
# #[cfg(feature = "json")]
# fn run() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
let resp = reqwest::blocking::get("http://httpbin.org/get")?;
if resp.status().is_success() {
