A function that returns a [`Subscriber`] that will write to either stdout or stderr:

```rust
# use tracing::Subscriber;
# use tracing_subscriber::fmt::writer::BoxMakeWriter;

fn dynamic_writer(use_stderr: bool) -> impl Subscriber {
