Return the serialization of this URL.

This is fast since that serialization is already stored in the `Url` struct.

# Examples

```rust
use url::Url;
# use url::ParseError;

# fn run() -> Result<(), ParseError> {
let url_str = "https://example.net/";
let url = Url::parse(url_str)?;
